    "identifier": "jiton-magnet-release-magnetic-polarization",
    "description": "<p>You focus your magnetic chakra on a point within range that you can see. Your chakra then expands to fill a 10-foot cube centered on that point, magnetizing any objects and creatures within that area when you cast this jutsu. Creatures in range must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, for the duration, the first weapon attack made each turn, against the target has advantage and they gain a rank of Sealed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and increase the size of the cube by +5 feet.</p>",
